WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.580
- Did some of the sitting justices

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:04.090
on the Supreme Court
lie about Roe v. Wade?

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:07.050
Many justices who are about
to overturn Roe and Casey

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.720
swore that precedent was settled

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:10.590
and that principles of stare decisis

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:13.260
require Roe v. Wade to remain in place.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:15.100
If they were lying, is there a penalty?

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.120
Well, Senator Susan Collins
would certainly be upset.

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:19.240
She said, quote, "If
this leaked draft opinion

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.560
is the final decision and
this reporting is accurate,

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:22.810
it would be completely inconsistent

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:24.990
with what Justice Gorsuch
and Justice Kavanaugh said

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:27.770
in their hearings and in
our meetings in my office."

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:30.580
The thing is, Supreme Court
justices have life tenure.

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:32.700
Life tenure means life tenure,

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.240
and the only remedy is impeachment,

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:37.933
which basically has never
happened in modern history.

